id: F04
target: src/sello/field.nim
desc: feFromBytes: shift-amount off-by-one in the final h0 carry step, 'shr 26' -> 'shr 25' (wrong limb-boundary bit count).
====OLD====
  var carry0 = (h0 + (1'i64 shl 25)) shr 26
  h1 += carry0
  h0 -= carry0 shl 26
====NEW====
  var carry0 = (h0 + (1'i64 shl 25)) shr 25
  h1 += carry0
  h0 -= carry0 shl 26
====END====
